---@class aws.quicksight.CreateAccountSubscriptionRequest
---@field Edition? aws.quicksight.Edition|string The edition of Amazon Quick Sight that you want your account to have. Currently, you can choose from ENTERPRISE or ENTERPRISE_AND_Q.
---@field AuthenticationMethod aws.quicksight.AuthenticationMethodOption|string The method that you want to use to authenticate your Quick Sight account.
---@field AwsAccountId aws.quicksight.AwsAccountId The Amazon Web Services account ID of the account that you're using to create your Quick Sight account.
---@field AccountName aws.quicksight.AccountName The name of your Amazon Quick Sight account. This name is unique over all of Amazon Web Services, and it appears only when users sign in. You can't change AccountName value after the Amazon Quick Sight account is created.
---@field NotificationEmail aws.quicksight.String The email address that you want Quick Sight to send notifications to regarding your Quick Sight account or Quick Sight subscription.
---@field ActiveDirectoryName? aws.quicksight.String The name of your Active Directory. This field is required if ACTIVE_DIRECTORY is the selected authentication method of the new Quick Sight account.
---@field Realm? aws.quicksight.String The realm of the Active Directory that is associated with your Quick Sight account. This field is required if ACTIVE_DIRECTORY is the selected authentication method of the new Quick Sight account.
---@field DirectoryId? aws.quicksight.String The ID of the Active Directory that is associated with your Quick Sight account.
---@field AdminGroup? aws.quicksight.GroupsList The admin group associated with your Active Directory or IAM Identity Center account. Either this field or the AdminProGroup field is required if ACTIVE_DIRECTORY or IAM_IDENTITY_CENTER is the selected authentication method of the new Quick Sight account.
---@field AuthorGroup? aws.quicksight.GroupsList The author group associated with your Active Directory or IAM Identity Center account.
---@field ReaderGroup? aws.quicksight.GroupsList The reader group associated with your Active Directory or IAM Identity Center account.
---@field AdminProGroup? aws.quicksight.GroupsList The admin pro group associated with your Active Directory or IAM Identity Center account. Either this field or the AdminGroup field is required if ACTIVE_DIRECTORY or IAM_IDENTITY_CENTER is the selected authentication method of the new Quick Sight account.
---@field AuthorProGroup? aws.quicksight.GroupsList The author pro group associated with your Active Directory or IAM Identity Center account.
---@field ReaderProGroup? aws.quicksight.GroupsList The reader pro group associated with your Active Directory or IAM Identity Center account.
---@field FirstName? aws.quicksight.String The first name of the author of the Amazon Quick Sight account to use for future communications. This field is required if ENTERPPRISE_AND_Q is the selected edition of the new Amazon Quick Sight account.
---@field LastName? aws.quicksight.String The last name of the author of the Amazon Quick Sight account to use for future communications. This field is required if ENTERPPRISE_AND_Q is the selected edition of the new Amazon Quick Sight account.
---@field EmailAddress? aws.quicksight.String The email address of the author of the Amazon Quick Sight account to use for future communications. This field is required if ENTERPPRISE_AND_Q is the selected edition of the new Amazon Quick Sight account.
---@field ContactNumber? aws.quicksight.String A 10-digit phone number for the author of the Amazon Quick Sight account to use for future communications. This field is required if ENTERPPRISE_AND_Q is the selected edition of the new Amazon Quick Sight account.
---@field IAMIdentityCenterInstanceArn? aws.quicksight.String The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) for the IAM Identity Center instance.

