---@field PerformanceConfiguration? aws.quicksight.PerformanceConfiguration The configuration for the performance optimization of the dataset that contains a UniqueKey configuration.
---@field UseAs? aws.quicksight.DataSetUseAs|string The usage of the dataset. RLS_RULES must be specified for RLS permission datasets.
---@field DataPrepConfiguration? aws.quicksight.DataPrepConfiguration The data preparation configuration for the dataset. This configuration defines the source tables, transformation steps, and destination tables used to prepare the data. Required when using the new data preparation experience.
---@field SemanticModelConfiguration? aws.quicksight.SemanticModelConfiguration The semantic model configuration for the dataset. This configuration defines how the prepared data is structured for an analysis, including table mappings and row-level security configurations. Required when using the new data preparation experience.

