---@field Column aws.quicksight.ColumnIdentifier The column that this level of the hierarchy drills down by. This column must belong to the same dataset as HierarchyFilter$Column.

---@alias aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterLevelList aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterLevel[]

---A control from a hierarchy filter that displays the hierarchy as a list. You can expand a value to see and select the values beneath it, and select either a single value or multiple values.
