---@field DisplayOptions? aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterListControlDisplayOptions The display options of a control.
---@field Type? aws.quicksight.SheetControlListType|string The type of the HierarchyFilterListControl. Choose one of the following options:
---@field CommitMode? aws.quicksight.CommitMode|string The visibility configuration of the Apply button on a HierarchyFilterListControl.
---@field ControlSortConfigurations? aws.quicksight.ControlSortConfigurationList The sort configuration for the values displayed in the control. Only one sort configuration can be applied per control.
---@field ControlTitleFormatText? aws.quicksight.ControlTitleFormatText The title text format configuration for the control.

---The display options of a control.
---@class aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterListControlDisplayOptions
---@field TitleOptions? aws.quicksight.LabelOptions The options to configure the title visibility, name, and font size.
---@field InfoIconLabelOptions? aws.quicksight.SheetControlInfoIconLabelOptions The configuration of info icon label options.
---@field SearchOptions? aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterListControlSearchOptions The configuration of the search options in a hierarchy list control.

---The configuration of the search options in a hierarchy list control.
---@class aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterListControlSearchOptions
---@field Visibility? aws.quicksight.Visibility|string The visibility configuration of the search options in a hierarchy list control.

---@alias aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterMatchOperator "INCLUDE"|"EXCLUDE"

---A node in the selection tree of a HierarchyFilter. Each node records the values that are selected at one level of the hierarchy. Nodes nest through Children to record selections at deeper levels.
---@class aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterNode
---@field Column aws.quicksight.ColumnIdentifier The column that this node selects values from. This column must match the column of the corresponding level in HierarchyFilter$HierarchyLevels. The node at depth 1 must match the first level, the node at depth 2 must match the second level, and so on.
---@field ParentValue? aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterValue|distilled.Secret The value in the parent node's HierarchyValues that this node belongs to. When a parent selects several values, each of its children repeats one of them here to identify which branch of the hierarchy that child describes.
---@field HierarchyValues? aws.quicksight.HierarchyValuesList The values that are selected at this level of the hierarchy. You can specify a maximum of 2,000 values per node.
---@field Children? aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterNodeList The nodes that record the selections at the next level of the hierarchy. You can specify a maximum of 1,000 children per node.

---@alias aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterNodeList aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterNode[]

---@alias aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterValue string

---@alias aws.quicksight.HierarchyId string

---@alias aws.quicksight.HierarchyValuesList aws.quicksight.HierarchyFilterValue[]

