---@field Email? aws.quicksight.String The user's email address.
---@field Role? aws.quicksight.UserRole The Quick Sight role for the user. The user role can be one of the following:.
---@field IdentityType? aws.quicksight.IdentityType The type of identity authentication used by the user.
